{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-01_end","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-01","title":"坍塌","storyCode":"0-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"84d26a1cec32a58600e4bdaeecc707928d981786d41ae650ff29e2df38d24e00","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"呃 ......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是......烏薩斯......人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，他們沒來得及聯絡同伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......做得不錯，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"是該客觀評價你的能力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，阿米婭......她去......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？謝，謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，這是我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你，你也是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們要做什麼！我，我的孩子......別傷害我們，求你了，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"去找個安全的地方藏身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，嗚......寬恕我們......饒了我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"各位休息好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，沒事......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她為什麼害怕你？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"類似的問題，你以前也問過呢。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我，得了病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我，還有杜賓，羅德島的大多數人，都得了病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就連剛才那些整合運動的成員也是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得了很重的病，讓人害怕的病......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“礦石病”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......得了礦石病的人，就是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"杜賓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯向來對感染者十分嚴苛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，誰又不是呢。只是烏薩斯在這方面的舉措，尤為冷酷罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"宣傳上讓民眾恐懼感染者，到了抓捕感染者的時候，民眾自然就習以為常，甚至拍手稱快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，整合運動才選擇了這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......這次，似乎不再是簡單的示威遊行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，他們開始大規模地使用暴力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"等到烏薩斯政府平息了事件，切爾諾伯格的感染者，只會遭到更殘酷的對待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......與之相反，有了Dr.{@nickname}你，羅德島的處境，也許能有所改善。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......這和我也有關係？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"那我還挺重要的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希和阿米婭都和我說過，你是最頂尖的礦石病研究學者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......現在，你陷入了記憶喪失的困境，我很懷疑，你還能不能再派上用場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔，杜賓教官，這麼說好過分！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許就和指揮一樣，等你稍作複習，說不定就能重新掌握那些理論？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟你還是前線指揮官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"其實之前，我怎麼也沒法把神經學博士和戰術家聯繫在一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你本人後，似乎好理解了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟羅德島本身就很像你的專業。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你！別跑！該注射藥劑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？啊？我沒事，我沒事呀！我，我還不需要治療！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是定量藥劑，延緩感染症狀的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才不是還說頭暈嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是同一種症狀吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"要是一會兒你的身體又出了問題，再碰上戰鬥怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"為了大家的安全你也該好好注意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"別動！我要扎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅德島就是這樣，既要找出治療感染者的辦法，又要減少感染者帶來的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——是的。光是研究治療方法，或者僅僅去平息種種爭端，都是不夠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須直面感染者帶來的所有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這樣，羅德島才能替感染者爭取到一線生機......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"作為感染者，我們也比普通人更能理解感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是普通人還是感染者，無論是和平還是紛爭，羅德島想要解決問題，而不是任由仇恨和疾病蔓延肆虐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，這可能也會是你職責的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少，這是我粗淺的請求。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在說什麼？？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我需要更慎重地思索一下。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會留給你很多時間的，你可以慢慢理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，給我們的時間卻不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"整頓隊伍，出發！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"前往會合點的路上，還不知道有什麼等著我們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米婭......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（切爾諾伯格現在的情況非常複雜，我們不能給整支救援隊伍帶去心理壓力。但是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（我們......還有多長時間？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（......三小時。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（三小時之後，天災將會吞沒這個城市。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（等到天災降臨，一切就都完了。）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"不確定因素。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"去，通知其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"我們追。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近衛幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["？？？"]}]}
